{"card":{"cardId":"7kAZQ","title":"To Build a Fire - The Soundscape Audiobook (Digital)","userId":"yoto","slug":"","metadata":{"category":"stories","description":"This classic survival story, commonly taught in school curricula, includes intense suspense and themes of mortal peril and death that may not be suitable for sensitive listeners.\n\n100% Human-Created Content. No generative AI was used for this production. \n\n“It certainly was cold.” A man ventures alone deep into the heart of the Yukon in the dead of winter during a bitter cold snap. Arrogant, he is heedless of the warnings given to him by others of the dangers of traveling without a trail mate. What follows is a classic cautionary tale of hubris.\n\nJack London’s masterful short story of one man’s fight to survive has chilled generations of readers. Now, Root & Twig Sounds presents this story of man facing nature’s power through the immersive experience of a soundscape audiobook. Read and performed by Phil Dragash and featuring original music by Alexander Amadeo.\n\nOriginal text published by Jack London in August of 1908 \nProduced as a Soundscape Audiobook in August of 2024\nRead and Performed by Phil Dragash\nDirected and Produced by A.Y. Barker and Phil Dragash\nOriginal Music Composed by Alexander Amadeo\nRoot & Twig Sounds Production Copyright ©2024\n\nJack London's viewpoint was a product of its time and place in history. Root & Twig Sounds believes in the importance of publishing soundscape audiobooks as an unabridged experience. We emphasize that the views and opinions are the author's own.\n\nRoot & Twig Sound's mission is to be a beacon of classic stories spectacularly done, helping the modern day listeners remember our great storytelling heritage. For the full Root & Twig Sounds experience of To Build a Fire and our complete list of works please visit our website and our Yoto page.\n\nwww.rootandtwigsound.com","minAge":10,"note":"Marketplace","abridged":false,"author":"Root & Twig Sounds","accents":["US English"],"authors":["Root & Twig Sounds"],"copyrights":["©2024 Root & Twig Sounds, LLC"],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/1cFBQWpl5z1iifSitSmj-lADak7drh60gFL0pKla81Yg~/pub/9rcS0unxYnoW-HWTxxeiO2wcdYDxT6MGIDhxMudxsGA"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":3675,"fileSize":43232158},"narrators":["Phil Dragash"],"creators":{"status":"approved"}},"content":{"version":"1","activity":"yoto_Player","config":{"resumeTimeout":2592000,"onlineOnly":false},"availability":"","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/1cFBQWpl5z1iifSitSmj-lADak7drh60gFL0pKla81Yg~/pub/9rcS0unxYnoW-HWTxxeiO2wcdYDxT6MGIDhxMudxsGA"},"playbackType":"linear","chapters":[{"duration":268,"fileSize":1670621,"key":"ZVS41-K_Qk","overlayLabel":"1","title":"Root & Twig Sounds - Prologue","availableFrom":null,"ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/klDyad-1gSkLs9IsncQi7RKJAXyvTYTosAulufzgP3g"},"tracks":[{"channels":"stereo","duration":268,"fileSize":1670621,"format":"opus","key":"ZJICjxqBah","overlayLabel":"1","title":"Root & Twig Sounds - Prologue","type":"audio","ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/klDyad-1gSkLs9IsncQi7RKJAXyvTYTosAulufzgP3g"}}]},{"duration":13,"fileSize":74027,"key":"kkn92UPRwi","overlayLabel":"2","title":"To Build a Fire - Intro Credits","availableFrom":null,"ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/sEbs809oaLZROb2eiT--POZMIQftFB4bBPXqYuQEvu0"},"tracks":[{"channels":"stereo","duration":13,"fileSize":74027,"format":"opus","key":"oCBbhwWwEt","overlayLabel":"2","title":"To Build a Fire - Intro Credits","type":"audio","ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/sEbs809oaLZROb2eiT--POZMIQftFB4bBPXqYuQEvu0"}}]},{"duration":2805,"fileSize":37370530,"key":"yh2oe5rYEF","overlayLabel":"3","title":"To Build a Fire","availableFrom":null,"ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yo